# Clerk regression evidence (synthetic fixtures and isolated local databases only).
!Docs/clerk/evidence/backend-full/backend-full-run.log
!Docs/clerk/evidence/backend-final/backend-full-run.log
!Docs/clerk/evidence/backend-handover/backend-full-run.log
!Docs/clerk/evidence/backend-release/backend-full-run.log
